# Browser
# "Any player may activate this ability but only during any upkeep step" (CR 602.2): Bot1's page clicks the {4} ability of
# the Clock Bot2 controls, in Bot1's own upkeep, paying with a Black Lotus and a Mox. The one doom counter Bot2's upkeep put on
# it is removed, so Bot2's next upkeep brings it back to one and its draw step deals 1 to each player, not 2.
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Armageddon Clock
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Armageddon Clock.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Armageddon Clock.Counters.Doom = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Armageddon Clock.Activate
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Armageddon Clock.Counters.Doom = (absent)
[T6 Bot2.Main1]
[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Armageddon Clock.Counters.Doom = 1
Bot1.Life = 18
Bot2.Life = 18
